Package: uzunyx-installer
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: emi <285864120+antarest47@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: apt, debconf
Description: Installs the Uzunyx desktop on Debian
 Carries every Uzunyx package in a local APT repository and the uzunyx-install
 command, which moves the system to the Debian release Uzunyx is built for if
 needed, installs Plasma if it is missing, and installs the desktop.
